msgid "The language of menus, screens and notices. Place names are always Slovene; what people in the city say, and mission texts, are still in English in this build."
msgstr "Jezik menijev, zaslonov in obvestil. Imena krajev so vedno slovenska; pogovori z ljudmi v mestu in besedila nalog so v tej različici še v angleščini."

