#: Source/MarburgumIIClient/Private/UI/MarburgumSettingsPanel.cpp(132)
msgctxt "MarburgumSettingsPanel,HudDesc"
msgid "How strongly the exploration HUD is drawn over the street. Screens and warnings stay opaque."
msgstr "Kako izrazito je HUD med raziskovanjem prikazan čez ulico. Zasloni in opozorila ostanejo neprosojni."

